<title>USA: Pacific Intl names Rogers unit president.</title>
<headline>Pacific Intl names Rogers unit president.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ALAMITOS, Calif. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific International Enterprises Inc said that its CRUSH Innovative Sports Systems Inc unit named Lee Rogers, coach of the U.S. Amateur Snowboard Team, as its new president.</p>
<p>As president of CRUSH, Rogers will be responsible for capturing market share with a line of T-BONE boots and bindings along with other snowboard products.</p>
<p>The company did not say whom Rogers succeeds.</p>
</text>
